python -m venv venv
. venv/bin/activate
pip install -e .
pip install --group dev

Dependency:
    https://homepages.cwi.nl/~aeb/go/sgfutils/html/sgfutils.html
    https://homepages.cwi.nl/~aeb/go/sgfutils/html/sgftf.html

Example ~/.config/game-tools/config.json file:
{
    "chess": {
        "algorithm": "fsrs",
    },
    "go": {
        "algorithm": "fsrs",
        "command": "sabaki"
    }
}

Either store config in ~/.config/game-tools/config.json and only log when
--log-file provides a path to file, or else store both in
~/.<tool-name>/config.json and ~/.<tool-name>/debug.logs. Either way, store
cards and review logs organized by algorithm in collection dirs, like this:

/path/to/collection
    .state
        fsrs
            cards.json
            review-log.jsonl
        leitner
            cards.json
            review-log.jsonl
